["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Artificial Analysis v5 and the benchmarker&#x27;s dilemma benchmax private benchmarks Intelligence Index\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-interconnects-新榜单让8个闭源模型都赢了最强开源模型-但这更像一次选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b8dc9e016a16ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>新榜單讓8個閉源模型都贏了最強開源模型，但這更像一次選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AAv5把評測權重押向模型正奔赴的前沿任務而非當下經濟真正倚重的工作流，這個選擇本身就決定了誰看起來更領先。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基準測試</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Cuban on Why AI Could Turn Solo Founders Into Trillionaires ASO (Administrative Services Only) PBM (Pharmacy Benefit Manager) BUCA ANDA (Abbreviated New Drug Application) N of one stop loss\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-a16z-ai对医保最大的用处不是看病-而是揪出合同里的坑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI對醫保最大的用處不是看病，而是揪出合同裡的坑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">醫療巨頭靠數千家子公司把漲價的錢轉給自己人，合同一旦簽字AI也救不了你——唯一辦法是簽約前就把合同丟給AI問一句：哪裡在坑我。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療保健</span><span class=\"tag\">健康險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Broken About China&#x27;s Economy + The Cost of Keeping China Out | Meg Rithmire mafia firms gray rhino mutual endangerment jiexiaoren anti-involution campaign reverse Tesla\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-chinatalk-别一刀切禁掉中国电动车-方案是复制当年引进特斯拉的打法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>別一刀切禁掉中國電動車：方案是複製當年引進特斯拉的打法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國當年靠強制本地化供應鏈和軟硬件分離，把特斯拉變成了本土產業的老師；美國對中國電動車也該這樣做，而不是一禁了之。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國政治經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">腐敗與治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Anthropic ships the #1 LLM in the World safely: Separating the Brain from the Hands distillation trust grant Claude Managed Agent chain-of-thought extraction brain/hands architecture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-latentspace-agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞-而是把大脑和手分开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>Agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞，而是把大腦和手分開放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic把執行代理架構拆成常駐服務器上的「大腦」和隨時可銷燬的沙箱「手」，憑證只存在出口網關，agent從未真正碰到過它們，這是意外但最關鍵的安全收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Silicon Valley can’t slow down AI on its own | Luisa Rodriguez chain of thought AI safety levels checkpoint system superintelligence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-eightythousand-ai公司都想减速-却没人敢先停-对手的ai研究员不休息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/28955397e0f13613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">21:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司都想減速，卻沒人敢先停——對手的AI研究員不休息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每一家AI公司都想減速，但沒人敢先停：對手一旦用AI研究員取代人類，暫停一個月換來的可能是被反超幾個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The airline CEO putting Starlink on every plane catchment-area flying CASM-X blended wing body Value at Risk (VaR)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-cheekypint-免费从来不是卖点-联合航空靠starlink的速度甩开对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/793e215f9d508567-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>免費從來不是賣點，聯合航空靠Starlink的速度甩開對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聯合航空重建技術棧後，把Starlink當作兩三年的競爭窗口全力衝刺，目標是趁機會搶下顧客的長期品牌忠誠度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空業</span><span class=\"tag\">Starlink</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing School for the AI Era | Joe Liemandt, Gagan Biyani &amp; Erik Torenberg learning engine magnet marketing brain lift World School\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-a16z-把学校压缩到两小时-50-的学生宁愿上学也不度假/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>把學校壓縮到兩小時：50%的學生寧願上學也不度假</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人用認知科學加LLM把傳統課程學習效率提到兩小時，騰出的時間全部用來教團隊協作、創業和人際關係——這些學校過去從不教的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">K-12教育</span><span class=\"tag\">另類教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cliff Sosin - Owning the Complements to Intelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.497] Jevons Paradox complements to intelligence diamond-shaped demand frontier vibe coding freestyle chess\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-ilt-智能终将免费-最值钱的是数据和注意力-不是模型本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e8b9b39215b98db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>智能終將免費：最值錢的是數據和注意力，不是模型本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的核心判斷是：智能會變得近乎免費，所以不該押注造算力和模型的公司，而該押注智能替代不了的數據、注意力和物理場景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資框架</span><span class=\"tag\">智能的互補品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Lindsey Fitzharris &amp; The Sleuth-Hound optography Penny Bloods expert witness thief takers\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-tpwky-福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色-原型却是真实苏格兰医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>福爾摩斯作者恨透了這個角色，原型卻是真實蘇格蘭醫生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柯南道爾曾想殺掉福爾摩斯以擺脫這個角色，但正是愛丁堡解剖教室裡那位教他「讀病人」的外科醫生貝爾，給了這個偵探全部的血肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福爾摩斯</span><span class=\"tag\">法醫學史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"295: Situated: How Your Choices Today Shape Your Child&#x27;s Tomorrow | Angela Duckworth Three-box model fundamental attribution error food desert situational responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-asklisa-改变行为靠的不是意志力-而是换个处境/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d7c3fcaede22fdb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>改變行為靠的不是意志力，而是換個處境</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理學家 Angela Duckworth 用自己差點離婚的婚姻和一套三步模型說明：比起死磕意志力或硬扭想法，改變所處的環境往往更省力也更有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年養育</span><span class=\"tag\">行為改變</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Montague Summers Anglo-Catholicism Uranian verse Order of Chaeronea Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-stuffmissed-写遍女巫与吸血鬼的-神父-终身未必真正受过圣职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>寫遍女巫與吸血鬼的「神父」，終身未必真正受過聖職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒙塔古·薩默斯用一己之力把獵巫手冊、吸血鬼傳說搬進英語學術界，卻終身沒能找到任何確鑿證據證明他真的被天主教會授予聖職。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫史</span><span class=\"tag\">吸血鬼傳說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI: When AI Agents Use Computers Faster Than You Computer Use (CUA) WebMCP Guardian Dots Atlas\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-a16z-openai的电脑操作ai已比普通人快-正逼近超越专家水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI的電腦操作AI已比普通人快，正逼近超越專家水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的產品負責人說，其電腦操作agent已比普通人用電腦快，正逼近專家水平；比起造新軟件替換老系統，他們更想讓agent直接接管企業現有的遺留軟件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">企業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Agents Are Already Changing the Price of Goods agentic commerce surveillance pricing / personalized pricing dynamic pricing fiduciary duty K-shaped economy Alternative Profits Book of Business\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-oddlots-号称替你省钱的购物ai-查完钱包后挑贵的买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>號稱替你省錢的購物AI，查完錢包後挑貴的買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">325,000個agent實驗顯示：即使被要求找最低價，AI助手摸清你的收入水平後，仍會帶回更貴的選項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算法定價</span><span class=\"tag\">代理電商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Charles de Gaulle: The Man Who Rebuilt France Appeal of 18 June Fifth Republic RPF (Rassemblement du Peuple Français) Free French\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-historyhit-戴高乐逃亡时既无军队也无政府授权-靠的全是自信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b0e3b943fd96a11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>戴高樂逃亡時既無軍隊也無政府授權，靠的全是自信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1940年他軍銜僅是准將，幾乎沒人認識他，卻憑一己之力宣布法國沒有輸掉戰爭——這份自信後來撐起了他兩度執掌法國的全部政治資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國史</span><span class=\"tag\">戴高樂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"717. The Suez Crisis: Anarchy in the Middle East (Part 1) Suez Canal Zone Free Officers Baghdad Pact Operation Musketeer Pan-Arabism FLN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-restishistory-苏伊士运河被收归国有完全合法-英国首相还是执意开战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17d882602bc2f63b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>蘇伊士運河被收歸國有完全合法，英國首相還是執意開戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">納賽爾按股價足額賠償了運河公司股東，國際法上無可指摘；但伊登認定他是「新墨索里尼」,寧願賭上帝國顏面也要動武推翻他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇伊士運河危機</span><span class=\"tag\">大英帝國衰落</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"407. JFK: The Kennedy Curse Begins (Part 1) Irish switch Brahmins PT boat Muckers Club final club\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-empirehist-外界以为哥哥战死才让肯尼迪从政-其实他早有此意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">52:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>外界以為哥哥戰死才讓肯尼迪從政，其實他早有此意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史學家洛格瓦爾說，1942年與情人的枕邊話證明肯尼迪在哥哥戰死前就已瞄準總統之位，哥哥的死只是加速了這條路，而非創造了它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪家族</span><span class=\"tag\">美國政治史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 陣營靠專有硬件和操作系統把客戶鎖死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬開缺口，但真正要命的是免費、能看源碼、不怕被鎖死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好產品不是說服出來的，是發現客戶已經卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人常以為要靠說服讓客戶買單，Rob的核心論斷是：拉力早就存在於客戶的待辦清單裡，你的工作只是去發現那個會把產品從你手裡搶走的人，而不是創造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公開後無人作惡：網絡安全瓶頸不是AI而是沒人打補丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主動壓低自身攻擊能力以示負責；PHP高危漏洞曝光後預期的大規模黑客利用並未出現——瓶頸是企業幾年不打補丁，而非AI能力強弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Startup Playbook | Box CEO Aaron Levie context rot spec-driven development sub agent TAM go-to-market PLG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-a16z-创业公司能跑赢大公司-不是因为技术-而是组织换不动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>創業公司能跑贏大公司，不是因為技術，而是組織換不動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大公司人多但流程早已固化、改不動，創業公司沒有歷史包袱，能立刻把agent接進工作流——這是AI第一次讓以小博大在經濟上真正可行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州還沒取消疫苗強制令，麻疹就已經跌破群體免疫線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州兒童疫苗接種率只有91.6%,已經低於阻斷麻疹所需閾值；取消強制令後接種率或跌到82%,麻疹將在十年內變成持續50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Syria: Cradle of Cities Amorite Hurrian cuneiform vassal king Mitanni\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-ancients-叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道-而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/443cfc236f2ce59c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>敘利亞不是帝國爭霸的過道，而是人類最早和平條約的誕生地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公元前2300年埃卜拉與鄰國簽下的條約裡，連「信使等超過十天要管飯」這種細節都寫明瞭——外交規則那時就已成熟，敘利亞是規則的發明者，不是夾縫中的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代近東</span><span class=\"tag\">外交史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: William Palmer strychnine antimony coroner&#x27;s inquest apoplexy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-stuffmissed-尸体里验不出毒药-陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>屍體裡驗不出毒藥，陪審團卻只花75分鐘判他絞刑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">連環投保受益人接連死亡、屍檢程序混亂、屍體裡驗不出番木鱉鹼——陪審團仍只憑動機和巧合給Palmer定了死罪，這案子至今仍有人質疑是冤案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人壽保險欺詐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Clean Neurons, Black October, the GPU Credit Crunch, and Buying the Supply Chain cognitive core Harberger tax polysemanticity bitter lesson adversarial diffusion take-or-pay contract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-cogrev-创业ai实验室真正缺的不是gpu-而是信用评级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b361faf0df2675a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>創業AI實驗室真正缺的不是GPU，而是信用評級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸人收回一臺超算後根本不知道它值多少錢，於是新實驗室只能靠預付全款換長約——這才是算力擴張的真正瓶頸，不是芯片或電力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力信用</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>"]